                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">First Phase: Background Research</h3>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            <li>• Literature review on feed-forward depth estimation</li>
